# Project Guardrails

- Keep edits minimal and localized to the requested scope.
- Do not edit generated outputs (`.next/**`, build logs, temporary files).
- Do not commit or modify sensitive files (`.env*`, credentials, private keys).
- Prefer preserving local style of touched files over broad style rewrites.
- Avoid destructive git operations unless explicitly requested.
- If a change may break existing behavior, call out the risk and add a verification step.
